  "notes": "IEA Wind Task 32 on wind lidar for wind energy applications is planning a new phase, starting in 2022. This PDF contains an overview of the concept for the phase. It was also used to collect feedback about the themes that would be addressed in the next phase. The presentation took place on 15th July 2021. This was the first of two workshops on the future concept for the Task. The participants were split into breakout rooms where they added more information to the slides for each of the four themes. This input is included in slides 21 to 35.",
